# Laravel adapter

Depends on core `Talaria\TalariaClient`. Integrate via the auto-discovered service provider — minimal app code.

## Rules

- Support Laravel **10 / 11 / 12** (`illuminate/support ^10 \|\| ^11 \|\| ^12`)
- Auto-discover `Talaria\\Laravel\\TalariaServiceProvider`
- Publish `config/talaria.php`; env names match Silverstripe (`TALARIA_DSN`, `TALARIA_API_KEY`, `TALARIA_ENABLE_TRACING`, …)
- Do not replace the app exception handler — hook `reportable`
- HTTP SERVER spans use route name or URI template for `http.route`
- Query spans via `QueryExecuted`; do not collapse identical SQL (N+1 stays visible)
- Queue: CONSUMER transaction per job; `flush()` + `resetRequestState()` after each job
- Never wrap Talaria ingest HTTP with tracing
- Octane / Horizon / Livewire are `suggest` + `class_exists` / `function_exists` — not hard requires
- Octane: `resetRequestState()` on receive; `flush()` on terminate
- Livewire: child spans only when a SERVER transaction is already open
- Tracing default off
